"In a gritty, dystopian underworld, where the lives of the desperate and the corrupt intertwine, a young and ambitious private investigator, Alex Mercer, is tasked with exposing a clandestine network of organ traffickers. The film opens in a dimly lit, seedy bar in a dilapidated part of the city, where Alex meets a mysterious figure named Sebastian, who operates on the fringes of this illegal trade. Sebastian knows the vendors who would buy human organs on the black market like the back of his hand.\n\n**Scene: A dimly lit bar in the seedy part of the city.**\n\nAlex Mercer, late 20s, a hard-edged detective with a troubled past, sits across from Sebastian, who is sipping a whiskey and staring intensely at Alex.\n\n**Sebastian:** \"These are the players you need to know. They operate in shadows, but I have my ways.\"\n\n**Alex:** (leaning in, his eyes narrowing) \"Let's hear it.\"\n\n**Sebastian:** (whispering) \"First up, there's Viktor Novak. He runs a private clinic in the shadows of the city. You'll find him at his favorite restaurant, 'La Belle Époque', on the second floor, near the elevator. Contact him through his personal assistant, Ms. Elena Kostova.\"\n\n**Alex:** (nodding) \"And how do I find the others?\"\n\n**Sebastian:** (smirking) \"For that, you'll need to be more resourceful. There's Dr. Elena Ivanov in the Eastern District. She's a former medical professor turned organ broker. You'll find her at 'The Academy Café'. For the final piece of the puzzle, you need to infiltrate the underground organ market at the 'Black Market Bazaar', where the most elusive vendors trade their wares. Use your charm and your connections, Alex. This is a dangerous game.\"\n\n**Alex:** (sternly) \"I don't play games, Sebastian. But if you have a way in, I'm listening.\"\n\n**Sebastian:** (sighing) \"I'll give you a piece of advice, Alex. In this world, trust no one. But if you want in, you have to prove your worth. Start with Novak. He'll give you a taste of what's to come.\"\n\n**Alex:** (standing up, determined) \"I'll start with Novak. See you in a week.\"\n\n**Sebastian:** (watching Alex leave) \"Good luck, Alex. This is only the beginning.\"\n\n**Alex:** (muttering to himself) \"It's just the beginning, Sebastian. It's just the beginning.\""
